      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The problem is that the creators whose avatars would benefit most from this system won't go to the trouble to implement it, since they didn't go to the trouble of optimizing the avatars in the first place.\nTo solve this there would have to exist some sort of automated process that doesn't require creators' input, maybe some sort of auto-decimation?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
